{
  "uid": "stockbot-logs-explorer",
  "title": "Log Explorer (Kibana 式)",
  "description": "多張預寫過濾條件的表格式 log 檢視:每張表以程式寫入的核心訊息 (message) 為主欄,JSON 欄位展開為欄;自由查詢請用左側 Explore (LogsQL)",
  "timezone": "Asia/Taipei",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "table", "title": "🟥🟩 交易成交 (買入 / 賣出 + 決策理由) — 固定回看 1 年", "id": 1,
      "description": "每筆成交一列:模式 (live 即時 / catchup 回放)、標的、市況、股數、價金與完整決策理由",
      "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "victorialogs" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "timeFrom": "1y",
      "hideTimeOverride": false,
      "targets": [{ "expr": "{service=\"app\"} \"成交\" | unpack_json | filter message:~\"買入成交|賣出成交\"", "refId": "A", "maxLines": 1000 }],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "extractFields", "options": { "source": "labels", "format": "json", "replace": false } },
        { "id": "filterFieldsByName", "options": { "include": { "names": ["Time", "message", "mode", "stock_id", "regime", "trigger", "shares", "price", "amount", "cash_after", "reason"] } } },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {},
            "indexByName": { "Time": 0, "message": 1, "mode": 2, "stock_id": 3, "regime": 4, "trigger": 5, "shares": 6, "price": 7, "amount": 8, "cash_after": 9, "reason": 10 },
            "renameByName": { "message": "訊息", "mode": "模式", "stock_id": "股票", "regime": "市況", "trigger": "觸發", "shares": "股數", "price": "成交價", "amount": "金額", "cash_after": "剩餘現金", "reason": "決策理由" }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Time", "desc": true }], "footer": { "show": false } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "filterable": true } },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Time" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 170 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "訊息" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 110 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "模式" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 90 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "決策理由" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.minWidth", "value": 320 }] }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table", "title": "⚙️ 開盤決策迴圈 / 回放 / 狀態還原 — 固定回看 7 天", "id": 2,
      "description": "開盤時段決策、catch-up 回放區間、BotState / 持倉還原;boot_id 可辨識是哪一次啟動",
      "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "victorialogs" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "timeFrom": "7d",
      "hideTimeOverride": false,
      "targets": [{ "expr": "{service=\"app\"} ~\"開盤|catch-up|首次啟動|還原|水位線|注資\" | unpack_json", "refId": "A", "maxLines": 1000 }],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "extractFields", "options": { "source": "labels", "format": "json", "replace": false } },
        { "id": "filterFieldsByName", "options": { "include": { "names": ["Time", "level", "message", "boot_id", "file"] } } },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {},
            "indexByName": { "Time": 0, "level": 1, "message": 2, "boot_id": 3, "file": 4 },
            "renameByName": { "level": "等級", "message": "訊息", "file": "出處" }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Time", "desc": true }], "footer": { "show": false } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "filterable": true } },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Time" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 170 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "等級" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 80 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "boot_id" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 100 }] }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table", "title": "📈 TWSE 資料回補 — 固定回看 7 天", "id": 3,
      "description": "初始回補與每日更新:回補月份、逐月抓取結果與完成標記",
      "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "victorialogs" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 9 },
      "timeFrom": "7d",
      "hideTimeOverride": false,
      "targets": [{ "expr": "{service=\"app\"} ~\"回補|每日資料更新|fetchAndInsertMonth|月份已標記完成|MarkComplete\" | unpack_json", "refId": "A", "maxLines": 1000 }],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "extractFields", "options": { "source": "labels", "format": "json", "replace": false } },
        { "id": "filterFieldsByName", "options": { "include": { "names": ["Time", "level", "message", "stock_id", "file"] } } },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {},
            "indexByName": { "Time": 0, "level": 1, "message": 2, "stock_id": 3, "file": 4 },
            "renameByName": { "level": "等級", "message": "訊息", "stock_id": "股票", "file": "出處" }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Time", "desc": true }], "footer": { "show": false } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "filterable": true } },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Time" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 170 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "等級" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 80 }] }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table", "title": "🚨 錯誤與警告 — 固定回看 30 天", "id": 4,
      "description": "warning / error / fatal 與無 level 欄位的原始輸出 (如 panic);error 欄為 WithError 帶入的錯誤內容",
      "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "victorialogs" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 18 },
      "timeFrom": "30d",
      "hideTimeOverride": false,
      "targets": [{ "expr": "{service=\"app\"} (level:~\"warning|error|fatal\" or level:\"\") | unpack_json", "refId": "A", "maxLines": 1000 }],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "extractFields", "options": { "source": "labels", "format": "json", "replace": false } },
        { "id": "filterFieldsByName", "options": { "include": { "names": ["Time", "level", "component", "message", "error", "file", "func"] } } },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {},
            "indexByName": { "Time": 0, "level": 1, "component": 2, "message": 3, "error": 4, "file": 5, "func": 6 },
            "renameByName": { "level": "等級", "component": "子系統", "message": "訊息", "error": "錯誤內容", "file": "出處", "func": "函式" }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Time", "desc": true }], "footer": { "show": false } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "filterable": true } },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Time" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 170 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "等級" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 80 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "子系統" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 110 }] }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table", "title": "🌐 HTTP access log", "id": 5,
      "description": "每個 HTTP request 一列;request_id 可對照 controller log 追同一請求",
      "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "victorialogs" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 18 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "{service=\"app\"} \"method\" | unpack_json | filter method:*", "refId": "A", "maxLines": 1000 }],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "extractFields", "options": { "source": "labels", "format": "json", "replace": false } },
        { "id": "filterFieldsByName", "options": { "include": { "names": ["Time", "method", "path", "status", "latency_ms", "request_id", "remote_ip"] } } },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {},
            "indexByName": { "Time": 0, "method": 1, "path": 2, "status": 3, "latency_ms": 4, "request_id": 5, "remote_ip": 6 },
            "renameByName": { "latency_ms": "延遲(ms)" }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Time", "desc": true }], "footer": { "show": false } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "filterable": true } },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Time" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 170 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "method" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 80 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "status" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 80 }] }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table", "title": "📜 全部 App log (Discover)", "id": 6,
      "description": "依時間倒序的完整 app log;訊息欄即程式中實際寫入的核心訊息,可在欄位標題輸入框過濾任何欄位",
      "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "victorialogs" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 27 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "{service=\"app\"} * | unpack_json", "refId": "A", "maxLines": 1000 }],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "extractFields", "options": { "source": "labels", "format": "json", "replace": false } },
        { "id": "filterFieldsByName", "options": { "include": { "names": ["Time", "level", "component", "message", "boot_id", "file", "func"] } } },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {},
            "indexByName": { "Time": 0, "level": 1, "component": 2, "message": 3, "boot_id": 4, "file": 5, "func": 6 },
            "renameByName": { "level": "等級", "component": "子系統", "message": "訊息", "file": "出處", "func": "函式" }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Time", "desc": true }], "footer": { "show": false } },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "filterable": true } },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Time" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 170 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "等級" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 80 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "子系統" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 110 }] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "boot_id" }, "properties": [{ "id": "custom.width", "value": 100 }] }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs", "title": "🔎 原始 log (點行展開全部欄位)", "id": 7,
      "description": "需要看單筆 log 的完整欄位 (含 version / request_id / 完整 JSON) 時用這裡:點任一行展開",
      "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "victorialogs" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 37 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "{service=\"app\"} * | unpack_json", "refId": "A", "maxLines": 1000 }],
      "options": { "showTime": true, "wrapLogMessage": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "enableLogDetails": true, "dedupStrategy": "none" }
    },
    {
      "type": "row", "title": "📖 自由查詢速查 (LogsQL,用於左側 Explore)", "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 46 },
      "panels": [
        {
          "type": "text", "title": "", "id": 9,
          "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 47 },
          "options": {
            "mode": "markdown",
            "content": "自由查詢請走 **左側選單 → Explore → 資料源選 VictoriaLogs**,貼上下列查詢。log 欄位:`message`(核心訊息)、`level`、`component`(子系統)、`mode`(live 即時 / catchup 回放)、`boot_id`(哪次啟動)、`version`(部署版本)、`file`/`func`(程式出處)、`request_id`(HTTP 請求關聯)。\n\n| 想知道什麼 | 查詢 (LogsQL) |\n|---|---|\n| 動用「打破冷卻」額度的買入 | `{service=\"app\"} ~\"打破冷卻\"` |\n| 只看開盤即時決策的成交 (排除回放補寫) | `{service=\"app\"} \"成交\" \\| unpack_json \\| filter message:~\"買入成交\\|賣出成交\" mode:=live` |\n| 重啟歷史:每次啟動各寫了多少 log | `{service=\"app\"} \\| unpack_json \\| stats by (boot_id) count() logs` |\n| 某一次啟動的完整時間線 (貼上 boot_id) | `{service=\"app\"} \\| unpack_json \\| filter boot_id:=xxxxxxxx` |\n| 錯誤/警告依子系統分布 | `{service=\"app\"} level:~\"error\\|warning\" \\| unpack_json \\| stats by (component) count() errs` |\n| 追蹤單一 HTTP 請求 (貼上 request_id) | `{service=\"app\"} \"xxxxxxxx\"` |\n| 部署版本對照 (行為從哪版開始變) | `{service=\"app\"} \\| unpack_json \\| stats by (version) count() logs` |\n\n**語法**:`*`=全部;AND=空白或 `and`;OR=`or`;NOT=`not`。全文關鍵字 `逾時`;精確片語 `\"發送啟動通知失敗\"`;欄位等於 `level:=error`、`stock_id:=00631L`;欄位含字 `message:成交`;regex `~\"買入\\|賣出\"`。JSON 欄位過濾前先接 `\\| unpack_json`。"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
